    "video_file_size": 27022310,
    "caption": "🗣 Mark Cuban: \"There will be the trillionaire in the basement\"\n\nOn an a16z podcast, Cuban says big companies struggle with AI until their bosses understand how it works. That leaves an opening: \"There's no better time to be an entrepreneur than right now.\"\n\nHe thinks AI still needs a person guiding it: \"AI is not smart. It's book smart maybe, but it's not street smart. It's not entrepreneur smart.\"\n\nHis demo for the head of a consumer food company: take their number one product, a cookie, and ask ChatGPT to create a competitor. \"And in about three minutes he was like, 'Oh, s**t.'\"\n\n@aipost 🏴",
